Error [jet.UseWhileWriteActive]: `pair` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> tests/ui/ownership/pattern_value_tests_and_reactive_clones_use_runtime_capture_places_2.jet:12:26
    |
 12 |         #Reactive { pair.left.push(3) }
    |                          ^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through a write parameter, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass `pair` only once, or copy first with `pair.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
